          "widgets": [
            {
              "id": "atlassian-audit-records-2",
              "definition": {
                "type": "note",
                "content": "**Jira** and **Confluence** keep audit records of administrative changes (permissions, groups, users, projects, spaces, workflows); the **Atlassian organization** keeps an audit log across products. This dashboard reads all three (sources `jira-audit-records`, `confluence-audit-records` and `atlassian`).\n\nConnect a site in [Integrations → Atlassian Audit Records](/integrations/connectors/atlassian-audit-records) with a site administrator's API token, and an organization API key for the organization's log.",
                "background": "white",
                "align": "left",
                "fontSize": "sm"
              },
              "layout": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 12,
                "h": 4
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 6
        }
